guide polestar-completionist-alliance/class-druid
title Druid class quests (10-60) (Completionist)
faction Alliance
class Druid
levels 10-60
category Class
zone Durotar
why Every Druid class quest from level 10 on, in level order. The earlier ones are in the starting zone guides.
reward text What the Druid quests give, quest by quest: abilities, forms, pets, totems or gear.
# Drafted from the reference data and repaired from lint: not yet played.
# Routed 22 quests; estimated level at the end 12.8 (heuristic XP).
# Skipped: 5 exclusive with N; 1 exploration objective has no location in data; 1 objective N (kill N) outside the zones; 1 objective N (talk N) outside the zones; 1 prerequisite N not in this route.

